<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NAWI Test Report Generator</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages/index.css">
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
            <i class="fas fa-balance-scale-right"></i> NAWI REPORTED
        </a>
        <div class="nav-center">
            <a href="#workflow">How it works</a>
            <a href="#capabilities">Features</a>
            <a href="#">About</a>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-actions">
            <a href="/login" class="btn-text">Sign In</a>
            <a href="/login" class="btn-primary">Get Started</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Automate NAWI Testing.</h1>
            <p>From instrument configuration to test execution, compliance evaluation and final report — all in one standardized digital workflow.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/login" class="btn-primary">Start New Test</a>
                <a href="#capabilities" class="btn-outline">Explore Platform</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
            <!-- Ensure this path points to the new image -->
            <img src="/images/scale-hero.jpg" alt="Industrial Weighing Scale">
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="workflow" class="timeline-section">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>The Testing Workflow</h2>
            <p>A standardized 4-step process for rigorous compliance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline">
            <div class="timeline-step">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <h3>Instrument Setup</h3>
                <p>Define specifications and physical conditions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-step">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <h3>Automatic Test Planner</h3>
                <p>Dynamically generates applicable tests based on class.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-step">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <h3>Guided Execution</h3>
                <p>Record digital observations against real-time limits.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-step">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <h3>Automated Report</h3>
                <p>Print standardized verification certificates.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="capabilities" class="capabilities-section">
        <div class="section-header" style="text-align:center;">
            <h2>Core Capabilities</h2>
            <p>Built for verification inspectors and manufacturers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cap-grid">
            <div class="cap-card">
                <div class="cap-icon"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list"></i></div>
                <h3>Automatic Test Planner</h3>
                <p>Dynamically generates the required test workflow—including Weighing Performance, Repeatability, and Eccentricity—based on the scale's Accuracy Class (I, II, III, IIII).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cap-card">
                <div class="cap-icon"><i class="fas fa-microchip"></i></div>
                <h3>R-76 Rule Engine</h3>
                <p>Automated Maximum Permissible Error (MPE) calculations and real-time compliance evaluation across Tier 1, 2, and 3 test load limits.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cap-card">
                <div class="cap-icon"><i class="fas fa-tasks"></i></div>
                <h3>Guided Test Execution</h3>
                <p>Record digital observations step-by-step. The system provides immediate visual feedback if errors exceed permissible limits during testing.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cap-card">
                <div class="cap-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-pdf"></i></div>
                <h3>Report Generator</h3>
                <p>Instantly generate an immutable, standardized PDF certificate with a granular breakdown of all test readings, errors, and overall Pass/Fail status.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
        &copy; 2026 NAWI Reported. SIH Prototype Built by Team Byte Brigade.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
